<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - John Q. Hammons raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - John Q. Hammons raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it upgraded John Q. Hammons Hotel L.P. to perform in line from underperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not available.</p>
<p>-- John Hammons gained 1/8 to 8-3/4.</p>
